=========================================================
STEP 6. IDENTIFY RESPONSIBILITIES
=========================================================

Each class should have ONE responsibility (SRP).

ParkingLot

Responsible for

• Managing floors
• Managing entry/exit

NOT

• Calculating payment

ParkingSpot

Responsible for

• Parking vehicle
• Releasing vehicle

Ticket

Responsible for

• Store entry time
• Store exit time
• Calculate fee

Payment

Responsible for

• Collect payment

DisplayBoard

Responsible for

• Show available spots

Interview Tip

Ask

"What is the single responsibility of this class?"



