=========================================================
MOST ASKED INTERVIEW QUESTIONS
=========================================================

Q1. How do you identify classes?

Answer

Look for nouns in the requirements.

Example

Parking Lot

ParkingLot
Vehicle
Ticket
Gate
Floor

---------------------------------------------------------

Q2. How do you identify methods?

Answer

Look for verbs.

park()

remove()

pay()

display()

calculateFee()

---------------------------------------------------------

Q3. How do you identify attributes?

Answer

Look for characteristics of an object.

Vehicle

vehicleNumber

vehicleType

ParkingSpot

spotId

occupied

---------------------------------------------------------

Q4. How do you identify responsibilities?

Answer

Apply the Single Responsibility Principle (SRP).

Each class should have only one responsibility.

---------------------------------------------------------

Q5. Which relationships are used?

ParkingLot HAS-A Floors

Floor HAS-A ParkingSpots

ParkingSpot HAS-A Vehicle

Vehicle HAS-A Ticket

ExitGate USES Payment

---------------------------------------------------------

Q6. Which design patterns can be used?

• Singleton
• Factory
• Strategy
• Observer
• State
• Command

